<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Benue Cement profits lower.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Benue Cement profits lower.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result for Benue Cement Plc to end-December 1995.</p>
<p>(In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				1995		1994</p>
<p>Turnover		    1,500	 vs 1,100</p>
<p>Profit before taxation    179.3     vs   204.2</p>
<p>Taxation			 33.9     vs    52.2</p>
<p>Profit after taxation     145.4     vs   151.9</p>
<p>Dividend			15 kobo   vs 15 kobo</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
</text>
